{"id":"wb-6-799","name":"张掖鼓楼","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"张掖鼓楼","text":"张掖鼓楼，又名靖远楼，位于中华人民共和国甘肃省张掖市甘州区市中心。该鼓楼始建于明代正德年间，清朝顺治年间时曾被烧毁，后于康熙年间重建。该鼓楼高28米，分为楼台和楼阁两部分组成，楼台下有门洞可供穿行，楼台上还有一口唐代的铜钟。2006年，张掖鼓楼被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BC%A0%E6%8E%96%E9%BC%93%E6%A5%BC","revisionId":93118671,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93118671","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/173daf685cbe6cebe89730ce.jpg","title":"Zhangye_Gulou_2014.01.02_09-21-01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Zhangye_Gulou_2014.01.02_09-21-01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/48/Zhangye_Gulou_2014.01.02_09-21-01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"张掖鼓楼","width":320,"height":213}}